<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2016-04-13a.117.1" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/10065" speakername="Julian Brazier" colnum="117" time="11:11:00" url="">
    <p pid="a117.1/1">Thank you, Ms Vaz. I failed to say how much I have enjoyed speaking under your chairmanship for the first time. The note says that cadets are assisted through squadron and wing HQ budgets. Similar to when they attend annual camps in mainland UK, food and accommodation are free to cadets.</p>
    <p pid="a117.1/2">Question put and agreed to.</p>
</speech>
